sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant W as web
  participant E as engine
  participant K as Redpanda
  participant S as stream-worker
  participant R as Redis
  participant L as Lake (MinIO)
  participant P as pipeline (daily)
  B->>W: open home
  W->>E: GET /recommend/{user}
  E->>R: read user features
  E-->>W: top-k + request_id + arm
  E-)K: exposures {request_id, user, arm, model, items}
  B->>W: Play game X
  W->>E: POST /event {user, X}
  E->>R: append X to history (SYNC)
  E-->>W: ok
  Note over B,R: read-your-writes: the very next /recommend sees X (no queue in between)
  E-)K: events {event_id, user, X, ts} + feedback {request_id, play}
  K-)S: consume (at-least-once)
  S->>R: update item popularity windows (async, every few s)
  S->>L: Parquet, partitioned by date
  P->>L: read yesterday's events (training + A/B data)
  P->>L: write run, gate, promote (pointer v+1)
  E->>L: watch pointer -> pull model -> smoke test -> swap
